message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "cislunar-custody: Custody horizons for ground-based angles-only tracking of cislunar periodic orbits"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nayak
    given-names: Bishwaswarup
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, Indian Institute of Science, Bangalore, India"
    email: bishwaswarup@iisc.ac.in
