version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bishwaswarup/cislunar-custody"
keywords:
  - cislunar
  - space domain awareness
  - angles-only orbit determination
  - near-rectilinear halo orbit
  - circular restricted three-body problem
  - uncertainty propagation
  - Gaussian mixture filter
  - unscented Kalman filter
abstract: >-
  Python code and data for a study of how long an object on a cislunar periodic orbit
  can go unobserved before it leaves a ground-based telescope search pattern (the
  custody horizon). Includes an Earth-Moon CR3BP orbit catalogue, a ground optical
  sensor and visibility model, Cramer-Rao bounds, EKF/UKF/Gaussian-mixture UKF/particle
  filters, linear/unscented/Monte Carlo gap propagation, and a JPL DE440 ephemeris +
  solar radiation pressure cross-check with multiple-shooting orbit counterparts.
